NOTE ON THE FONTS THIS TOOL PRODUCES

This licence covers the TOOL only.  The fonts it produces carry whatever
licence their source material carried: the glyphs come from the PDF
documents named in the manifest, and from any external font the manifest
names.  The tool records the source and licence of each external font in
its report, under `base_fonts`.  It does not grant any rights to those
fonts.
